title: moon3_electric_intro
---
Milo: The Electric Moon! Service and bonding.
Milo: A train of ghost children just appeared on the dormant rails. Translucent. Sad.
Milo: They want to help. They want to build.
===

title: moon3_lirael_remembers_train
---
Lirael: *(trembling)*
Lirael: This train. I was on this train.
Lirael: We sang to keep the mud away. We sang until our throats gave out.
Lirael: And then I was alone in the dark, listening for the song.
===

title: moon3_first_orphan_speaks
---
Orphan_Child: Can I help? I remember how the domes used to smile.
Orphan_Child: We were architects' children. We knew the songs. We were learning to build.
Orphan_Child: Tell me what to build and I will build it. While you sleep, even.
===

title: moon3_resonance_rail_explainer
---
Milo: The rails hum when correctly aligned. 432 Hz baseline, with rhythmic peaks.
Milo: Cut new ties in giant mode — precision work. Then place them along the ley line.
Milo: When the train can move again, the children can ride. And then they will build.
===

title: moon3_train_attacked
---
Milo: Reset agents! They've planted dissonance along the tracks!
Milo: Protect the children! Repair the rail!
Milo: *(spectral screams in the background)*
===

title: moon3_climax_first_song
---
Lirael: I remember the song now.
Lirael: *(begins to sing, clear and impossible — children join in spectrally)*
Lirael: This is the first time I've sung since the train broke.
Lirael: Thank you, traveler. For waking me enough to remember.
===
